Third-party code vendored into Research OS (DESIGN.md 22.0.1)
====================================================================

Written by tools/vendor/build-codemirror.mjs; do not edit by hand.

These files are code Research OS did not write. They are served same-origin by
GET /vendor/<name> from an allow-list (webapp/server.py, _VENDOR_FILES), never
fetched from a network, and loaded only by the LaTeX editor through
ROLatex.loadEditorLibs() (webapp/latex.js). The tests that scan the page's
scripts and styles skip this folder by name.

codemirror.js
-------------
CodeMirror 6, bundled by esbuild 0.28.2 (MIT) as an IIFE that sets
window.ROCodeMirror; options: {"bundle":true,"format":"iife","globalName":"ROCodeMirror","minify":true,"target":"safari16","legalComments":"none","charset":"ascii"}.
Exports: ChangeSet, Compartment, Decoration, EditorSelection, EditorState, EditorView, HighlightStyle, MapMode, RangeSet, RangeSetBuilder, StateEffect, StateField, StreamLanguage, Text, Transaction, ViewPlugin, WidgetType, defaultKeymap, drawSelection, highlightSpecialChars, history, historyKeymap, keymap, placeholder, redo, redoDepth, search, searchKeymap, stex, syntaxHighlighting, tags, undo, undoDepth.

Packages (all bundled; each one's licence text is LICENSE.<package> here):
- @codemirror/commands 6.11.1 (MIT)
- @codemirror/language 6.13.1 (MIT)
- @codemirror/legacy-modes 6.5.5 (MIT)
- @codemirror/search 6.7.2 (MIT)
- @codemirror/state 6.7.6 (MIT)
- @codemirror/streamparser 6.0.0 (MIT)
- @codemirror/view 6.43.15 (MIT)
- @lezer/common 1.5.5 (MIT)
- @lezer/highlight 1.2.5 (MIT)
- @marijn/find-cluster-break 1.0.4 (MIT)
- crelt 1.0.7 (MIT)
- style-mod 4.1.4 (MIT)
- w3c-keyname 2.2.8 (MIT)

KaTeX (22.0.1, batch B3) is not vendored yet; its katex.js, katex.css and
fonts/*.woff2 will be added here by a script of its own, with its rows below.

